  "selected_alignment_score_max": 0.606364,
  "segments": [
    {
      "sentence_index": 1,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "It seems as if a great deal were attainable in a world where there are so many marriages and decisive battles, and where we all, at certain hours of the day, and with great gusto and despatch, stow a portion of victuals finally and irretrievably into the bag which contains us.",
      "output_sha256": "19c74d6fee8bb873022ee96d2ea9ac9e602d43e107d271f8e1a0b111e74b7013",
      "alignment_unit_index": 1,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 1,
      "source_human_sha256": "19c74d6fee8bb873022ee96d2ea9ac9e602d43e107d271f8e1a0b111e74b7013",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 2,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "And it would seem also, on a hasty view, that the attainment of as much as possible was the one goal of man’s contentious life.",
      "output_sha256": "0941ab5a196f0be89c7bdaeb1cde5884ab7eb71a51c70c20c5a26d047128b47e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 2,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 2,
      "source_human_sha256": "0941ab5a196f0be89c7bdaeb1cde5884ab7eb71a51c70c20c5a26d047128b47e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 3,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "And yet, as regards the spirit, this is but a semblance.",
      "output_sha256": "4acff9d241f7ef635e45921febc22584aff0fb6f2a28f3376797861b41c43e07",
      "alignment_unit_index": 3,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 3,
      "source_human_sha256": "4acff9d241f7ef635e45921febc22584aff0fb6f2a28f3376797861b41c43e07",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 4,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "We live in an ascending scale when we live happily, one thing leading to another in an endless series.",
      "output_sha256": "102c012dcfe64f6f68a388f0c93d80cb08741341b81b82719399576c04460d10",
      "alignment_unit_index": 4,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 4,
      "source_human_sha256": "102c012dcfe64f6f68a388f0c93d80cb08741341b81b82719399576c04460d10",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 5,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "There is always a new horizon for those who aspire, and although we inhabit a small planet, engaged in trivial matters and fleeting moments of life, our hopes remain as distant as the stars.",
      "output_sha256": "ef85f7d6883f2632f01b701fdfdbe052decb9e2f80ab776f1b44b02f891ae2e3",
      "alignment_unit_index": 5,
      "alignment_score": 0.447827,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        5
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "a9d3ebbf8ca0d8ec8b34046d71540e8072b421bd0adc30170bc6c68f8042c1b7"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 6,
      "source_ai_sha256": "ef85f7d6883f2632f01b701fdfdbe052decb9e2f80ab776f1b44b02f891ae2e3",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        6
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 6,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "To be truly happy is a question of how we begin and not of how we end, of what we want and not of what we have.",
      "output_sha256": "6f1108d14a8b5ae8bc99c1143e306856ddec5f0dc0dba37fec9d51f9b84a1e30",
      "alignment_unit_index": 6,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 6,
      "source_human_sha256": "6f1108d14a8b5ae8bc99c1143e306856ddec5f0dc0dba37fec9d51f9b84a1e30",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 7,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "An aspiration is a joy for ever, a possession as solid as a landed estate, a fortune which we can never exhaust and which gives us year by year a revenue of pleasurable activity.",
      "output_sha256": "b42a67946576434e3dbc92f2f0ccf72cdaae341d1b055c8ada9657d48074eb86",
      "alignment_unit_index": 7,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 7,
      "source_human_sha256": "b42a67946576434e3dbc92f2f0ccf72cdaae341d1b055c8ada9657d48074eb86",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 8,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "The presence of numerous aspirations renders a person spiritually affluent.",
      "output_sha256": "2ca27670524402bd4d20df0f8143b524fcd61dc4454a227e13bd0b5af4d9737e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 8,
      "alignment_score": 0.32,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        8
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "fdee0df4129216aff9ffd623d56dd3ba99c557856b24da86109a1e925eb159b8"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 10,
      "source_ai_sha256": "2ca27670524402bd4d20df0f8143b524fcd61dc4454a227e13bd0b5af4d9737e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        10
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 9,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Without such interests, life becomes a dull and poorly directed performance; for those lacking art or science, the world is reduced to a mere collage of colors or a perilous path fraught with potential missteps.",
      "output_sha256": "906ebb61f048ed69138b878f34e6c748d08a055dbfb8ddfe6a8443f04bcd132a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 9,
      "alignment_score": 0.377377,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        9
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "6c0b64e83d8a814ef858ef1eee0e3f3379264456cbd4774f50eab815dbd682b9"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 11,
      "source_ai_sha256": "906ebb61f048ed69138b878f34e6c748d08a055dbfb8ddfe6a8443f04bcd132a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        11
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 10,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "It is in virtue of his own desires and curiosities that any man continues to exist with even patience, that he is charmed by the look of things and people, and that he wakens every morning with a renewed appetite for work and pleasure.",
      "output_sha256": "5ea63c97922009cad8b0779952d23c35df7d08d2b13312aa30f1e0a82912d0de",
      "alignment_unit_index": 10,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 10,
      "source_human_sha256": "5ea63c97922009cad8b0779952d23c35df7d08d2b13312aa30f1e0a82912d0de",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 11,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Desire and curiosity are the two eyes through which he sees the world in the most enchanted colours: it is they that make women beautiful or fossils interesting: and the man may squander his estate and come to beggary, but if he keeps these two amulets he is still rich in the possibilities of pleasure.",
      "output_sha256": "922058441d433e1806612bcc398419b45a30f0fba6a57b73380216deb0539770",
      "alignment_unit_index": 11,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 11,
      "source_human_sha256": "922058441d433e1806612bcc398419b45a30f0fba6a57b73380216deb0539770",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 12,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Suppose he could take one meal so compact and comprehensive that he should never hunger any more; suppose him, at a glance, to take in all the features of the world and allay the desire for knowledge; suppose him to do the like in any province of experience—would not that man be in a poor way for amusement ever after?",
      "output_sha256": "b68c9b08309b3189daa60ae2e5c97ffc85b6937d222565b56ab6822cc72bb8e3",
      "alignment_unit_index": 12,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 12,
      "source_human_sha256": "b68c9b08309b3189daa60ae2e5c97ffc85b6937d222565b56ab6822cc72bb8e3",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 13,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "One who goes touring on foot with a single volume in his knapsack reads with circumspection, pausing often to reflect, and often laying the book down to contemplate the landscape or the prints in the inn parlour; for he fears to come to an end of his entertainment, and be left companionless on the last stages of his journey.",
      "output_sha256": "56120f3d5206896fb45a0e4179fd337401be2fac6e39c324a02d6d6f97b93299",
      "alignment_unit_index": 13,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 13,
      "source_human_sha256": "56120f3d5206896fb45a0e4179fd337401be2fac6e39c324a02d6d6f97b93299",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 14,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "A young man recently completed his reading of Thomas Carlyle's works, concluding with the ten notebooks on Frederick the Great.",
      "output_sha256": "7c3ffbd29af204a9e703968bae504a13d11c6b9c4d71775edc0c1f886be8f54f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 14,
      "alignment_score": 0.517121,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        14
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "322167a58c72145e3d637cacf8602507f58846524207c3a25882eed523307ace"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 20,
      "source_ai_sha256": "7c3ffbd29af204a9e703968bae504a13d11c6b9c4d71775edc0c1f886be8f54f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        20
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 15,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "\"What!\" he exclaimed in dismay, \"Is there no more Carlyle?",
      "output_sha256": "4ce4f4a1dfb63021c6dde799f72b7e9f42afd43a32ded5edda6d093d51f76a82",
      "alignment_unit_index": 15,
      "alignment_score": 0.606364,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        15
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "d4ba2f03228a9e2cf648be1a755bf03162bd5967a7f3dc529e9c086a06be7f8e"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 21,
      "source_ai_sha256": "4ce4f4a1dfb63021c6dde799f72b7e9f42afd43a32ded5edda6d093d51f76a82",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        21
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 16,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Am I left to the daily papers?”",
      "output_sha256": "18dd476336387850cf848e889d795f160be0980bfd6dce39d7682270e8eb4b99",
      "alignment_unit_index": 16,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 16,
      "source_human_sha256": "18dd476336387850cf848e889d795f160be0980bfd6dce39d7682270e8eb4b99",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 17,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "A well-known instance involves Alexander the Great, who wept for the absence of new worlds to conquer.",
      "output_sha256": "ccae1662ba6770daf1fa25970fe5f7956f45269510b5482f2d92ed8d0bbb14be",
      "alignment_unit_index": 17,
      "alignment_score": 0.453947,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        17
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "09ec44a6101f40abaceba3924360bddca122da564b0dd20f32730f52c08284aa"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 23,
      "source_ai_sha256": "ccae1662ba6770daf1fa25970fe5f7956f45269510b5482f2d92ed8d0bbb14be",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        23
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 18,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "And when Gibbon had finished the Decline and Fall , he had only a few moments of joy; and it was with a “sober melancholy” that he parted from his labours.",
      "output_sha256": "21c9297397028f34fd956c70965b72d3baff1e7069ec0069474b8f2addadac97",
      "alignment_unit_index": 18,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 18,
      "source_human_sha256": "21c9297397028f34fd956c70965b72d3baff1e7069ec0069474b8f2addadac97",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 19,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Happily we all shoot at the moon with ineffectual arrows; our hopes are set on inaccessible El Dorado; we come to an end of nothing here below.",
      "output_sha256": "9b0a57090ac4877fe48cd9950a7e0fcba480040420b491cd267a09d53d150067",
      "alignment_unit_index": 19,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 19,
      "source_human_sha256": "9b0a57090ac4877fe48cd9950a7e0fcba480040420b491cd267a09d53d150067",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 20,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Interests are only plucked up to sow themselves again, like mustard.",
      "output_sha256": "de05cf6edbf584f79dff6bfcf69b0883cabc13dda029189f3e49d6d6848b6098",
      "alignment_unit_index": 20,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 20,
      "source_human_sha256": "de05cf6edbf584f79dff6bfcf69b0883cabc13dda029189f3e49d6d6848b6098",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 21,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "You would think, when the child was born, there would be an end to trouble; and yet it is only the beginning of fresh anxieties; and when you have seen it through its teething and its education, and at last its marriage, alas! it is only to have new fears, new quivering sensibilities, with every day; and the health of your children’s children grows as touching a concern as that of your own.",
      "output_sha256": "e86d27acfc56465b4ba022ec2a7da8ad15174eb408c5e4bd5d77a6d83f39b5f4",
      "alignment_unit_index": 21,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 21,
      "source_human_sha256": "e86d27acfc56465b4ba022ec2a7da8ad15174eb408c5e4bd5d77a6d83f39b5f4",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 22,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Again, when you have married your wife, you would think you were got upon a hilltop, and might begin to go downward by an easy slope.",
      "output_sha256": "625e5597044e5eb5983357767a12d23be082fbb1da96701804f22a9f3bc81637",
      "alignment_unit_index": 22,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 22,
      "source_human_sha256": "625e5597044e5eb5983357767a12d23be082fbb1da96701804f22a9f3bc81637",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 23,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "However, the end of courting simply leads into the complexities of marriage.",
      "output_sha256": "aff17cd239114d4f29ea123d9e80c8fbda3d4ad6464772335901e23247608704",
      "alignment_unit_index": 23,
      "alignment_score": 0.29026,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        23
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "d255d8053e36f3700215991f3f05397a22797cef0741fd7d0be2fbd8170f61c7"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 32,
      "source_ai_sha256": "aff17cd239114d4f29ea123d9e80c8fbda3d4ad6464772335901e23247608704",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        32
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 24,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "While the pursuit of love can be arduous for obstinate spirits, maintaining that love is equally demanding, requiring both partners to invest kindness and goodwill.",
      "output_sha256": "1c72c36949e57afb48d9b50a7bd6bf6724fc7c410c5400da27720ee4aa90f577",
      "alignment_unit_index": 24,
      "alignment_score": 0.29274,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        24
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "fd8ad5f835f1715fabb34d4a67f4350c2a60cd76a9626af33547194cc7249e2f"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 33,
      "source_ai_sha256": "1c72c36949e57afb48d9b50a7bd6bf6724fc7c410c5400da27720ee4aa90f577",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        33
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 25,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "The true narrative of love begins at the altar, where the newlyweds face a beautiful contest of wisdom and generosity, along with a lifelong pursuit toward an ideal that remains perpetually out of reach.",
      "output_sha256": "764cda34c9acf7e338fe030e8f99fa04cc085bf2825ac75b7573816fa21088d3",
      "alignment_unit_index": 25,
      "alignment_score": 0.540465,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        25
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "5014dff1dde2d80d81b9c388b8d171e7a30e52c37f88467a1c9c7cfe0a091dff"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 34,
      "source_ai_sha256": "764cda34c9acf7e338fe030e8f99fa04cc085bf2825ac75b7573816fa21088d3",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        34
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 26,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Unattainable?",
      "output_sha256": "9f3cf64c5ceaf66114f5034f5417c9d0bf535feef69560acb8c2c9c6c68cf301",
      "alignment_unit_index": 26,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 26,
      "source_human_sha256": "9f3cf64c5ceaf66114f5034f5417c9d0bf535feef69560acb8c2c9c6c68cf301",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 27,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Indeed, it is, simply because there are two individuals instead of one.",
      "output_sha256": "0fca8a719d90401303fd86f7bafbf02f18d919e3419af4cac3db6cb24e6b11cd",
      "alignment_unit_index": 27,
      "alignment_score": 0.419505,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        27
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "df35a0476644fb04a00e489ed00ea5412089228a8adf9832c12e46344a28f4c4"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 36,
      "source_ai_sha256": "0fca8a719d90401303fd86f7bafbf02f18d919e3419af4cac3db6cb24e6b11cd",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        36
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 28,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "“Of making books there is no end,” complained the Preacher; and did not perceive how highly he was praising letters as an occupation.",
      "output_sha256": "95f0798a0954032172b04840e3fcdb1a8d33f1fdcade4861275aa1b350ffb45a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 28,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 28,
      "source_human_sha256": "95f0798a0954032172b04840e3fcdb1a8d33f1fdcade4861275aa1b350ffb45a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 29,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "There is no end, indeed, to making books or experiments, or to travel, or to gathering wealth.",
      "output_sha256": "824ae890c57ddfc016ef6094a6239cb13190dfc211d734f6e3077595834f7c45",
      "alignment_unit_index": 29,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 29,
      "source_human_sha256": "824ae890c57ddfc016ef6094a6239cb13190dfc211d734f6e3077595834f7c45",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 30,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Problem gives rise to problem.",
      "output_sha256": "a552f5064b4ff792219588577ff6f5ab70fcc615fb889294704a91c825ce8057",
      "alignment_unit_index": 30,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 30,
      "source_human_sha256": "a552f5064b4ff792219588577ff6f5ab70fcc615fb889294704a91c825ce8057",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 31,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Our studies can continue indefinitely, yet we never attain the level of knowledge we desire.",
      "output_sha256": "64ef0a79b0174bd112e4192d37c9453a4cd04b175481b7d09b92d974526fdcb1",
      "alignment_unit_index": 31,
      "alignment_score": 0.268736,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        31
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "7493a44c0b91b229704a161a1a7097da81991234a847780557fefb14433e979d"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 40,
      "source_ai_sha256": "64ef0a79b0174bd112e4192d37c9453a4cd04b175481b7d09b92d974526fdcb1",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        40
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 32,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "We have never made a statue worthy of our dreams.",
      "output_sha256": "631433ab61ad342de8d4e8a0c5cb4b6928216ef47c24d7e77de00f77a93bb3e2",
      "alignment_unit_index": 32,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 32,
      "source_human_sha256": "631433ab61ad342de8d4e8a0c5cb4b6928216ef47c24d7e77de00f77a93bb3e2",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 33,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "And when we have discovered a continent, or crossed a chain of mountains, it is only to find another ocean or another plain upon the further side.",
      "output_sha256": "337e55e27169d6af30085791682a78f7fc64624e29a40f51f71b0ea16ca1934f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 33,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 33,
      "source_human_sha256": "337e55e27169d6af30085791682a78f7fc64624e29a40f51f71b0ea16ca1934f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 34,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "The universe is boundless, offering ample space for our most diligent pursuits and more.",
      "output_sha256": "009c04ae42b44a6c64a846b16281c4bf37574e0f41627a856d9792eda3ece9fe",
      "alignment_unit_index": 34,
      "alignment_score": 0.414286,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        34
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "ca52d0125e15bb6dc2477f4f496b5bd15a73fb3fd519e60dd1fdbf3d447e3f35"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 43,
      "source_ai_sha256": "009c04ae42b44a6c64a846b16281c4bf37574e0f41627a856d9792eda3ece9fe",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        43
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 35,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "It is not like the works of Carlyle, which can be read to an end.",
      "output_sha256": "48e34d7470e893f2d26be689810bee950054bd53276ae4c60453fb508613640e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 35,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 35,
      "source_human_sha256": "48e34d7470e893f2d26be689810bee950054bd53276ae4c60453fb508613640e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 36,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Even in a corner of it, in a private park, or in the neighbourhood of a single hamlet, the weather and the seasons keep so deftly changing that although we walk there for a lifetime there will be always something new to startle and delight us.",
      "output_sha256": "26bd954a4169b9c84ad743a175e11b285854707ef9677cd14a57ed1da9d9e468",
      "alignment_unit_index": 35,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 36,
      "source_human_sha256": "26bd954a4169b9c84ad743a175e11b285854707ef9677cd14a57ed1da9d9e468",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 37,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "There is only one wish realisable on the earth; only one thing that can be perfectly attained: Death.",
      "output_sha256": "66b772b3178191c367541f14754fefaf976a517f8fd497c7825459397ef2cd98",
      "alignment_unit_index": 36,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 37,
      "source_human_sha256": "66b772b3178191c367541f14754fefaf976a517f8fd497c7825459397ef2cd98",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 38,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "And from a variety of circumstances we have no one to tell us whether it be worth attaining.",
      "output_sha256": "15abaf893384d4c920764334edf3e630ca39138fe935b18cba95accc68dfb4c2",
      "alignment_unit_index": 37,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 38,
      "source_human_sha256": "15abaf893384d4c920764334edf3e630ca39138fe935b18cba95accc68dfb4c2",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 39,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "As we journey toward our elusive dreams, we paint a peculiar picture, marching onward while begrudging ourselves the necessary moments of rest; we are tireless and adventurous pioneers.",
      "output_sha256": "46b20450b9168c790cc9812c3e96cc02cf0f000e4461a1fd7bf4649e3258fd00",
      "alignment_unit_index": 38,
      "alignment_score": 0.370374,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        39
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "13d6c8ddbdd9e4145d842e26648d5c60628e54023b3e088c88a35bc8e1cdc239"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 47,
      "source_ai_sha256": "46b20450b9168c790cc9812c3e96cc02cf0f000e4461a1fd7bf4649e3258fd00",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        47
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 40,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "It is true that we may never reach our goals; it is highly likely that no such destinations exist.",
      "output_sha256": "6ff1dc4e379fbc8037863b144f5e711203e31b6f58c836c385bfd1f690ea3951",
      "alignment_unit_index": 39,
      "alignment_score": 0.544645,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        40
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "908174073c95ac9b8b6aa8eab477deb99cfbb3b125553acba9af0eb5d54a45a1"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 48,
      "source_ai_sha256": "6ff1dc4e379fbc8037863b144f5e711203e31b6f58c836c385bfd1f690ea3951",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        48,
        49
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 41,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Even if we lived for centuries and possessed divine powers, we would find ourselves not significantly closer to our desires at the end.",
      "output_sha256": "b10e312605d48c35b19cff48e665f6f6d3da5f9ef7b229c2b0294a8be7c0c873",
      "alignment_unit_index": 39,
      "alignment_score": 0.544645,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        40
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "908174073c95ac9b8b6aa8eab477deb99cfbb3b125553acba9af0eb5d54a45a1"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 49,
      "source_ai_sha256": "b10e312605d48c35b19cff48e665f6f6d3da5f9ef7b229c2b0294a8be7c0c873",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        48,
        49
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 42,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "O toiling hands of mortals!",
      "output_sha256": "f13202cd461557f293cd9a9469572e9da912e6a4a5102fe5ac43046df741eef3",
      "alignment_unit_index": 40,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 41,
      "source_human_sha256": "f13202cd461557f293cd9a9469572e9da912e6a4a5102fe5ac43046df741eef3",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 43,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "O unwearied feet, travelling ye know not whither!",
      "output_sha256": "815786d5d56e1dfa113daf230c149bb5eb4c9f9770682d2a392249862601dfbc",
      "alignment_unit_index": 41,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 42,
      "source_human_sha256": "815786d5d56e1dfa113daf230c149bb5eb4c9f9770682d2a392249862601dfbc",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 44,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Soon, soon, it seems to you, you must come forth on some conspicuous hilltop, and but a little way further, against the setting sun, descry the spires of El Dorado.",
      "output_sha256": "a24c1bf07968243ce1dbef0398b3cfde14e6e5b7508598b2d0be6c461091e620",
      "alignment_unit_index": 42,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 43,
      "source_human_sha256": "a24c1bf07968243ce1dbef0398b3cfde14e6e5b7508598b2d0be6c461091e620",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 45,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Little do ye know your own blessedness; for to travel hopefully is a better thing than to arrive, and the true success is to labour.",
      "output_sha256": "8b2c1430bfa885f71f1da680ca572cef5b07b270b5eb054ba5230038c101aad0",
      "alignment_unit_index": 43,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 44,
      "source_human_sha256": "8b2c1430bfa885f71f1da680ca572cef5b07b270b5eb054ba5230038c101aad0",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    }
  ]
}
